      "side": 1,
      "message": "as in most configuration, the KEYSCAN task has higher priority than the task triggering the simulate_key (CONSOLE?), this sequence seems sub-optimal :\ntask_wake(TASK_ID_KEYSCAN) will de-schedule us and trigger the scan (or at least the beginning of it), then we only record \"old_polls\" here after this first sequence.",
