      "writtenOn": "2013-12-09T19:05:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hrm.  Something isn\u0027t adding up, then.  I polled kbd_polls before and after the task_wake and it was the same.  \n\nOh, I need http://crosreview.com/169334\n\nOK, so after I add that it works _better_, but not perfect.  I _think_ the problem is when we\u0027re sitting in the \"usleep(wait_time)\" (AKA when we\u0027re in polling mode).  It appears that the task_wake() doesn\u0027t wake up from the usleep().  I think that means we should keep ensure_keyboard_scanned(), right?",
      "parentUuid": "83e41a52_3018b68e",
      "revId": "3cfc72bc7d4d3e090e51ff4796169f71d828bac3",
