      "writtenOn": "2013-12-09T19:46:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "yes, the task_wake() won\u0027t wake up the task from usleep(wait_time) (actually it will wake it up then go back to sleep because it\u0027s not the expected timer event)\nwe would need to use : task_wait_event(wait_time) to have interruptible sleep (but then we no longer guaranty minimum delay there, so maybe we don\u0027t want that).\n\nwe should probably keep ensure_keyboard_scanned, just the current implementation is not optimal, it would be nice to record the old_polls value before the task_wake.",
